{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/swordborn_library_logo_1280x720max.png?t=1747589732\" /><i>SwordBorn</i> is a  pixel RPG adventure where you're chosen by the king to uncover the mystery of sudden portals spawning dangerous monsters across the realm. Explore different maps  and beyond each filled with secrets, dungeons, and unique biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fish, mine, hunt, craft weapons and gear, and farm your land. Unlock skills, level up, raise pets, and solve ancient puzzles. With a skill tree to shape your playstyle and a central village that evolves with your progress, <i>SwordBorn</i> delivers a classic RPG experience with deep progression and modern flair.<br><br><strong>Combat :\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 Weapon Variety &amp; Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with simple sword, but unlock powerful <strong>rune-infused swords</strong>, <strong>bows</strong>, and <strong>throwables</strong> as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon class has unique attack ranges, speeds, and combo potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>charged attacks</strong>, <strong>dash strikes</strong>, and <strong>counter techniques</strong> through your <strong>skill tree</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/ezgif-3a6235a8a13f53.gif?t=1747589732\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft :</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f Blacksmith Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit blacksmiths across the land to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge powerful <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>armor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine <strong>rare materials</strong> found from monsters, mining, or hidden chests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine gems with gears for extra stats boosts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock gear with unique stats like <strong>SP regeneration</strong>, <strong>AGI boosts</strong>, or massive <strong>HP reserves</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each item has its own attributes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ATK / DEF</strong> values that directly affect combat outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SP (Stamina Points)</strong> for skill use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AGI (Agility)</strong> for movement and dodge speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HP boosts</strong> for survival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/ezgif-3b0ee898a7e7e3.gif?t=1747589732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gems :\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LVL 1\u00a0 :\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl1GreenGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl1BlueGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl1OrangeGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl1RedGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl1YellowGem.png?t=1747589732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LVL 10:\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl2GreenGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl2BlueGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl2OrangeGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl2YellowGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl2RedGem.png?t=1747589732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LVL 20:\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl3BlueGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl3YellowGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl3RedGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl3OrangeGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl3GreenGem.png?t=1747589732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LVL 30:\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl4GreenGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl4BlueGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl4YellowGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl4OrangeGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl4RedGem.png?t=1747589732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LVL 40:\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl5BlueGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl5GreenGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl5YellowGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl5RedGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl5OrangeGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><br><strong>Mining, farming, Fishing :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br>\ud83c\udf31 Resource Gathering in <i>Swordborn</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Swordborn</strong>, exploration isn't just about combat \u2014 it's also about thriving. Whether you're growing food, mining crystals, or chopping ancient trees, resource gathering feeds directly into crafting, survival, and puzzle-solving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\ude93 Core Gathering Activities</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Farming</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant crops, water them, and harvest materials like herbs, roots, or food items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow ingredients used in <strong>healing items</strong>, <strong>potions</strong>, or <strong>crafting reagents</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26cf\ufe0f <strong>Mining</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strike ore veins and unearth <strong>gems</strong>, <strong>metals</strong>, and <strong>rare crystals</strong> used for weapon upgrades and rune tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some ores are locked behind special tools, requiring upgrades to access deeper materials.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Woodcutting</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chop trees to gather <strong>logs</strong>, <strong>bark</strong>, and other materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wood is essential for tools, gear handles, and certain puzzles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fishing</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch fish used in  <strong>trading</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different waters yield different species \u2014 explore coasts, rivers, and icy lakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Hunting</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track and hunt wild animals across various biomes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain hides, bones, meat, and rare monster parts used in crafting<br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/ezgif-3e69d3df80a7da.gif?t=1747589732\" /><strong></strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727280?t=1747589732","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727280?t=1747589732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/72c9f6c18cb2f15ea7e18f85af1ce46d02408a38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747589732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/72c9f6c18cb2f15ea7e18f85af1ce46d02408a38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747589732","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/swordborn_library_logo_1280x720max.png?t=1747589732\" /><i>SwordBorn</i> is a  pixel RPG adventure where you're chosen by the king to uncover the mystery of sudden portals spawning dangerous monsters across the realm. Explore different maps  and beyond each filled with secrets, dungeons, and unique biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fish, mine, hunt, craft weapons and gear, and farm your land. Unlock skills, level up, raise pets, and solve ancient puzzles. With a skill tree to shape your playstyle and a central village that evolves with your progress, <i>SwordBorn</i> delivers a classic RPG experience with deep progression and modern flair.<br><br><strong>Combat :\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd39 Weapon Variety &amp; Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with simple sword, but unlock powerful <strong>rune-infused swords</strong>, <strong>bows</strong>, and <strong>throwables</strong> as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon class has unique attack ranges, speeds, and combo potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>charged attacks</strong>, <strong>dash strikes</strong>, and <strong>counter techniques</strong> through your <strong>skill tree</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/ezgif-3a6235a8a13f53.gif?t=1747589732\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft :</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f Blacksmith Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit blacksmiths across the land to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge powerful <strong>weapons</strong> and <strong>armor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine <strong>rare materials</strong> found from monsters, mining, or hidden chests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine gems with gears for extra stats boosts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock gear with unique stats like <strong>SP regeneration</strong>, <strong>AGI boosts</strong>, or massive <strong>HP reserves</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each item has its own attributes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ATK / DEF</strong> values that directly affect combat outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SP (Stamina Points)</strong> for skill use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AGI (Agility)</strong> for movement and dodge speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HP boosts</strong> for survival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/ezgif-3b0ee898a7e7e3.gif?t=1747589732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gems :\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LVL 1\u00a0 :\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl1GreenGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl1BlueGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl1OrangeGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl1RedGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl1YellowGem.png?t=1747589732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LVL 10:\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl2GreenGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl2BlueGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl2OrangeGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl2YellowGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl2RedGem.png?t=1747589732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LVL 20:\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl3BlueGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl3YellowGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl3RedGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl3OrangeGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl3GreenGem.png?t=1747589732\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LVL 30:\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl4GreenGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl4BlueGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl4YellowGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/lvl4OrangeGem.png?t=1747589732\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/