hind special tools, requiring upgrades to access deeper materials.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Woodcutting</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chop trees to gather <strong>logs</strong>, <strong>bark</strong>, and other materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wood is essential for tools, gear handles, and certain puzzles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fishing</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch fish used in  <strong>trading</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different waters yield different species \u2014 explore coasts, rivers, and icy lakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Hunting</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track and hunt wild animals across various biomes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain hides, bones, meat, and rare monster parts used in crafting<br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/extras/ezgif-3e69d3df80a7da.gif?t=1747589732\" /><strong></strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["KMOON"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727280/6bb5f53a6195524c85de16f31a5d49b2f22a8160/header.jpg?t=1747589732","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135880,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135880/movie480.mp4?t=1746730517","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135880/movie_max.mp4?t=1746730517"},"name":"SwordBorn | First Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s